message: "If you use this archive, please cite it as below."
title: "Musical Intelligence Reproduction Archive — Results Layer"
abstract: >-
  Per-phase reproduction verdict ledger and constant-level provenance audit
  for the Musical Intelligence (MI) system. Reproduces 1,097 pass/fail
  verdicts (180 claim-style CSV records + 917 pytest sub-tests) on a frozen
  engine pin (commit 318eb2f529d7103e8b7d80b01228357fdc4e0217; aggregate
  SHA-256 482ade45c50f5d3bf5c90c122e495b2c3230e6e6edc6542f72f22e3b5da37f88).
  Runs engine-free and audio-free in reviewer cache-mode in approximately
  55 minutes on a MacBook Air M2 8 GB. Heavy artefacts (138 GB MI engine
  pre-compute and ~3 GB Gen-2 dataset metadata) are vendored separately on
  Zenodo; the cache substrate (~185 MB) needed for reviewer-mode pytest is
  included alongside the Zenodo data deposit.
